+## What this is
+
+**A WebView-based remote UI that drives a real Bluetooth HID
+connection.** `arklight build`'s output (an SVG remote face plus its
+JS/CSS) is loaded into a full-screen `WebView`. Tapping a button on
+that UI doesn't call some app-specific remote-control API — it sends
+an actual Bluetooth HID report, over a Classic-Bluetooth HID Device
+profile connection this app registers and drives itself, to whichever
+already-paired host (TV, PC, ...) accepts it. As far as the host is
+concerned, this phone is a Bluetooth keyboard.
+
+See [`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) for how the pieces
+below fit together, and [`docs/BLUETOOTH-HID.md`](docs/BLUETOOTH-HID.md)
+for the HID protocol detail.
+
